# Per-Dockerfile ignore for docker/dataset/Dockerfile (BuildKit, docker >= 23).
# Same rationale as docker/ingest/Dockerfile.dockerignore: repo-root context,
# no repo-root .dockerignore allowed. NOTE: `docker` is NOT excluded here —
# this build COPYs docker/dataset/entrypoint.sh.
.git
data
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
_vendor
